alxq_l\"> <h2>典型案例</h2> <ul> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"../cases/8.html\">金融</a></li> <li class=\"bg\"><a href=\"../cases/9.html\">电信</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"../cases/10.html\">能源</a></li> <li class=\"\"><a href=\"../cases/7.html\">政府</a></li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"alxq_r\"> <div class=\"al_dh\"> <p><a href=\"../case.html\">典型案例</a> > <a href=\"../cases/9.html\">电信</a> > <a href=\"589.html\">运营商省公司统一接触库项目</a></p> </div> <style> .al_dhx { font-family: siyuanheiti!important;} </style> <div class=\"al_dhx\"> <h2>运营商省公司统一接触库项目</h2> <h1 style=\"text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">项目背景</span></h1><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;统一接触库系统承载业务较多，包括CRM 系统的菜单权限管理、操作员维护、组织机构维护、工号鉴权登录等系统管理功能， 还承载在线公司的部分应用，其业务支撑范围遍布全省营业厅。</span></p><br/><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">建设方案</span></h1><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\"><img src=\"../ueditor/php/upload/image/20230907/1694055382675453.png\" title=\"1694055382675453.png\" alt=\"image.png\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: medium; text-wrap: wrap; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p><h1 style=\"text-wrap: wrap; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px; font-size: 32px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">成果价值</span></h1><p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· 2021 年 12 月正式上线，是该省移动B 域核心业务系统首个数据库国产化上线项目</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· 基于生产模型进行性能对比测试，GreatDB 整体比 Oracle 快 51%</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· 项目建设过程涉及业务与管理两大域，横跨业支安全室、业务响应室 、云计算室（运维）3 大科室，涉及兼容性改造、分片方案、业务测试、系统组网等 12 个子项协同</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· GreatDB 具备强 Oracle 兼容能力， 包括序列、connect by、rownum 及各类 Oracle 函数等</span></p><p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, SimKai; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">· 提供 Oracle 数据库迁移评估，缩短业务评估改造周期</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"footer\"> <div class=\"container\